Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,how has my White Cloud Sect offended you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't explain this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:14.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't live another day !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I use the restriction flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,maybe I can take a few blows from these Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid it will be recognized in the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd rather avoid trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that the White Cloud Sect has Soul Formation cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to challenge them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope you can forgive my intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Transform !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Middle stage Nascent Soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're overestimating yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Clone !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,My teleportation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.91,0:03:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,was cancelled ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Formation's domain is hidden in his spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Experience it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are all so shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you ever look at yourself once ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This energy cannot be blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is my Desperate Emotions Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was the right call to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He abandonned happiness and anger, love and hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:00.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,He understood emotions, but gave up on feeling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Long live Lord Immortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is extremely ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,To form this domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So heartless...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:14.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,A domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is what a domain is !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess Senior came here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to allow your disciple to experience domains
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to breakthrough to Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You, come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:30.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1293,498)\fad(300,300)}Shi Qi\NWhite Cloud Sect Elder\NSoul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although Senior's cultivation is sky high,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:34.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you can order our White Cloud Sect around !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're all as stubborn as a cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You act exactly like your old Patriarch White Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestral Spirit Token !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Senior has the Ancestral Spirit Token,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,we Juniors must obey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,but is Senior sure to want to use this token
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to have all our Soul Formation cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,attack your disciple to help him experience domains ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You, come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have a good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I had a chance to experience domains
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,back when I tried to reach Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have had a much smoother path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slowly experience this old woman's domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:35.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't been for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:38.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,am I doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:18.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for the beads of killing intent,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:20.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have been completely lost in her domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:25.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Middle stage Nascent Soul was able to resist my domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:27.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,It never happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.46,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1250,500)\fad(300,000)}Qing Song\NWhite Cloud Sect Elder\NSoul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your domain is quite special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once he experiences it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,we won't bother you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,He cannot withstand
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nonsense !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,With me here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:52.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if your old Patriarch White Cloud were to come personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would hold him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time is accelerating ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:20.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,my spiritual energy is fading...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:57.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,His domain can deplete all my spiritual energy and cause my body to age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it were to affect my life energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,my life would be drained away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,My domain is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the passing of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excellent !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What an amazing domain !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you ever reach Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,your domain will be heaven defying !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys can keep this token.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm getting old...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only teleport 100 000 li.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:29.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,what was that Ancestral Token ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just a piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's one of my hobbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:39.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is from the Heaven Escape Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is from the Spirit Fog Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is from the Giant Demon Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is one is from a rank 5 country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wanna buy one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can make a token of any sect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Would you like a White Cloud Sect Leader token ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:57.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior's technique is something Junior has never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:09:59.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You only know this one line ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.55,0:10:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've experienced some domains already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can keep the hat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now quickly reach Soul Formation and make wood carvings of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:17.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Domains...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:30.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Desperate love can turn into despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,True happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,turns one empty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:40.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the passing of time ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here to bring you wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Da Niu !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:39.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(242,617)}17 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are getting old, you should drink less.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It isn't good for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:52.38,Second,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:55.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:56.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bride has so much dowry !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:58.94,Second,,0,0,0,,Come to my house for a drink !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:11:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is the bride beautiful ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,She is !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:08.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,This piece of land is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shopkeeper Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this shop prosperous enough to pay the debt ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at my chubby son !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,he finally fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mister Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will definitely pay the rent next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:30.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:31.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have come !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mister Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,come and taste my new orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't pay the rent today,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,then get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without realizing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I ended up owning most of the street as I lent money to more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:55.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,All living beings
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,travel through heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:13:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Almost 20 years have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is the domain I am looking to form ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can neither see it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,nor understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:21.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:24.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(328,438)}Ceng Xiao Niu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can I have a candy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I stole this wine for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,does this wine taste good ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see you drinking it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:38.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't drink anymore today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:41.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just one last sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't drink anymore today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Da Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,how is your father ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same old illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:00.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you haven't told me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,how the wine tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not wine that Grandpa Wang drinks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to see where you can run off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1422,501)\fad(300,300)}Yi Fu\NWhite Cloud Sect Disciple\NFoundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mister Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:39.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the problem ? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,His Highness the Crown Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:43.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought he was looking for real backup
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's just a mortal...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Xu Tao came to find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,you two must have a close relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:56.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will also
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:57.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,be close together in death !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want to bother with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,My soul was damaged !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:22.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:24.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not a mortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:27.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you want me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been turning mortal for decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't ruin it for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:39.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's late already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:43.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,please find two pairs of hands
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,to help me carry this man into my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:58.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think we should report this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang really is a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:14.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second son, sixth son,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:15.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Help me to carry this man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,into Shopkeeper Wang's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I don't intervene,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.39,0:16:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to see Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:53.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:55.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you so badly injured ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to see Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.18,Second,,0,0,0,,How could a mortal cause such injuries ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:16:59.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master ! Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fu'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:16.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1628,544)\fad(300,300)}Zhou Wutai\NWhite Cloud Sect Elder\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:32.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:32.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:36.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:41.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:41.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:47.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:47.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:51.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:57.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:57.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:02.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:02.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:06.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:06.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:10.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:10.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:14.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.56,0:18:22.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:22.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:29.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:29.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:37.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:37.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:46.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:46.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:23.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:23.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:31.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:31.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:40.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:40.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:48.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:48.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
